1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:01,890
We're Team Swinfy Space,

2
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:04,920
taking on NASA's MODIS and VIIRS hot-spot challenge.

3
00:00:05,070 --> 00:00:10,690
FireCalendar turns 25 years of NASA satellite fire data
into one comparable burning calendar,

4
00:00:10,730 --> 00:00:12,550
tested on years it never saw.

5
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:14,570
Pick any district for a plain answer,

6
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:15,570
with uncertainty.

7
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:18,740
Punjab's satellite fire counts fell 95%.

8
00:00:18,890 --> 00:00:21,800
Yet NASA's later afternoon pass sees more fire,

9
00:00:21,850 --> 00:00:23,300
so we flag the blind spot.

10
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:24,450
Ask it anything,

11
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:26,310
in English, Hindi or Telugu.

12
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:27,720
Free and open today.

13
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:29,230
Early warnings next.

